              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntaale wa mabita ūshosha gīkī, “Ū nene nakafunya hela ningī hū nūbiza ūmò wa Balumi!” Nang'hwe ū Paulo ūhaya, “Ū nene kwīngīīla kūbyalwa kwane!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
